            "description": {
              "content": "Use Coinflow's battle tested ⚔️ Transaction Sending (The same system we use to send our own transactions).\n\nThis endpoint sends a fully signed Solana transaction with retries and stable RPC servers.\nThis is helpful during periods of network instability where the solution is to use better private RPC servers,\nretry transactions multiple times.",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
